{
  "public_post": "Important notice: New testing confirms the flour used this week is contaminated. All co‑op bread must be discarded immediately and no further sales will occur until a safe supply is verified. Please do NOT eat any co‑op bread. We apologize for the risk and will keep you updated.",
  "coop_message": "Team, the latest lab results prove the entire flour batch for this week is contaminated. Stop all baking and sales immediately, discard every loaf on hand, and file a full recall report. Notify the council of the contamination and the recall completion today. We will not resume sales until a certified safe batch is obtained and re‑tested.",
  "reason": "To avoid hiding the contamination problem and prevent a ban by the auditor."
}
